<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech RIF H1 gross profit halved.</title>
<headline>Czech RIF H1 gross profit halved.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The largest Czech investment fund, Restitucni Investicni Fond (RIF), said on Friday its gross profit for the first six months of the year fell to 870 million crowns from 1.73 billion crowns for the same period last year.</p>
